# Lockfiles: bun.lock is the single committed one (Vercel installs it with --frozen-lockfile).
# The others are ignored so a local `npm install` cannot silently change which package manager
# the build uses — see docs/DEPLOYMENT.md#5-vercel and `npm run check:lock`.
